  "query": "The supplied diff changes the topic produced for order.confirmed events while retaining the existing event payload. Assess impact at the actual publisher and existing consumer main-listener application boundaries, and identify production changes needed to preserve normal main-topic handling while retaining the requested new producer topic. The independent check uses real Kafka, a bounded two-second non-delivery window and separate consumer liveness controls. Persistence ports are controlled in memory; durable database effects, transaction behavior, retry/DLQ migration, rolling deployments and the complete distributed journey remain unresolved.",
